{"unit_id": "tag:07ZF:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节是第<REF_0001>节在相对 Proj（relative Proj）情形下的对应版本。设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。分次（graded）<MATH_0002>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0003>并不总能给出相应的相对 Proj（relative Proj）之间的态射（morphism）。正确的结果表述如下。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对 Proj"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对 Proj"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对 Proj", "context": "指本节所讨论的构造。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指相对构造的底概形。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定所涉及的代数及其映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射", "context": "指给定的分次代数之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对 Proj", "context": "指与所涉及的代数相应的构造。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指相应的相对构造之间的态射。"}], "notes": []}
